              "text": "A neuter noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "પગલું (paglũ) is built on પગ, a foot, which CDIAL sets under Sanskrit padga- (CDIAL 7766), with the ending -lũ. It is a step, and the sound or the print a step leaves: કોઈનાં પગલાં, someone's footsteps."
            }
          ]
        },
