          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ખખડાવવું — khakhḍāvvũ — \"to knock (at a door)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "અડધી રાત્રે કોઈએ બારણું ખખડાવ્યું. aḍdhī rātre koīe bārṇũ khakhḍāvyũ. In the middle of the night someone knocked at the door."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with તેણે (he or she …): તેણે બારણું ખખડાવ્યું, teṇe bārṇũ khakhḍāvyũ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ખખડાવવું (khakhḍāvvũ) is the causative of khakhaḍvũ, to rattle, an imitative word: CDIAL sets Gujarati khaṛkhaṛvũ, \"to rattle\", under Sanskrit khaṭakhaṭāyatē, \"crackles\" (CDIAL 3771), and this verb probably belongs with it. To knock is to make the door rattle."
            }
          ]
        },
